FR:
{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0004:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0006:}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Bah alors ?!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Fallait surtout pas vous
presser, hein...{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Encore un peu, et je venais vous
chercher en personne,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}} !{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

DE:
{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0004:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0006:}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Hey!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Ihr seid spät dran, ihr zwei!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Ich wollt schon die Laufschuhe
schnüren und nach euch suchen,
{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0008:}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Du hast echt Nerven, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}
durch die Gegend zu hetzen, nur um
mich herzulotsen.
Ich hoffe für dich, dass wenigstens
was halbwegs Wichtiges anliegt,
{{TAG:0011:0001:0000}}!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}Du hast mir doch immer von dieser
einen Sache erzählt, die du gerne
hättest{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ich hab sie gefunden!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Und ich hab sie dir gekauft!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

FR:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:0003:0012:}}{{TAG:0007:000B:}}Ah...!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} C'est vrai que ça fait des
lustres que je cherche {{TAG:000E:0002:}}
{{TAG:0011:0003:0000}}...{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Sauf que là, c'est pas du tout le bon
modèle, {{TAG:0011:0001:0000}}...{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000A:}}T'aurais dû m'en parler avant de
gaspiller tes clochettes,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}...

ES:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}Resulta que estaba por ahí fuera
jugando a la rayuela extrema{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
y me encontré una cosilla.
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Esto es tuyo, ¿no?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}El caso es que{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} me gustaría
aprender cosas de esas de listos.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}A ver si puedes enseñarme algo.
Porque a ti te gusta pensar.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}} ¡Y
además vienes cuando te llamo!
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}¿Entonces qué?{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} ¿Me ayudas?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Mesele şu{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} biraz akıllı insan işi
şeyler öğrenmem gerektiğini düşünüyorum.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Bir öğretmene ihtiyacım var.
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Bana senin öğretmeni istediğine karar verdim.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Güvenilirsin ve akıllısın,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}} üstelik
çağırınca geliyorsun!
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Değil mi?{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} Var mısın?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

DE:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:0003:0012:}}{{TAG:0007:000B:}}Ich soll dir Unterricht geben?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Bwa ha ha!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Das wäre was!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0028:}}Du wirst dich allerdings ein wenig
gedulden müssen.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Guter Unterricht erfordert
gründliche Vorbereitung,
{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}{{TAG:0000:0003:0500}}(Ich bin geliefert. {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Ich muss sofort
nach Hause und mir kluge Sachen
anlesen!){{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:0003:0021:}}Bugün sana bir iyilik yapacağım.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Bugün bana{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0011:0001:0000}}, {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Masaj Ustası
diyebilirsin!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Bazılarının senin aşırı dik
kafalı olduğunu söylediğini duydum.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0026:}}
Güzel bir kafa derisi masajı
kafanı yumuşatır!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

ES:
Bueno, creo que con esto ya he
socializado para toda la semana.{{TAG:0007:0000:19000000}}
Cojo el camino,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.
{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0004:}}Siento que te hayas tomado tantas
molestias para tan poca cosa,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0008:}}.

EN:
Well, {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}I better get going now.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0004:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Make sure this knucklehead rewards
you for making you do his errands!

TRANSLATION:
Pekâlâ, {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}ben artık gideyim.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0004:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
